": "23893865583647395", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295272_23893865596980727_102457676305495909_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GEy5QpavhCgQ7kNvwG224Bo&_nc_oc=Adq5KkQXjX5aJ_DWXZ436UV_3Cu4Sm42hyaVK12u64hAboPMN64jx9ZuLkifoQnTGg4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHSM7TCk4egrFZC-Oqex3ELwrQ46OhHZVovvnj12kQ7Ig&oe=6A79BC80"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Jungle - Virtual Forest Tour", "keywords": ["Jungle", "Forest", "Animal", "ForestTour"], "long_description": "Experience the Wonders of the Jungle Like Never Before!\n\nVR Jungle Tour transports you deep into the vibrant, mysterious world of the rainforest. Walk through dense canopies, cross rivers, and come face-to-face with exotic wildlife all from the comfort of your VR headset.\n\nFeel the thrill as parrots soar overhead, monkeys swing from tree to tree, and hidden creatures rustle through the undergrowth. Every corner of the jungle is alive with detail, from the sounds of tropical birds to the flowing waterfalls and changing weather.\n\nWhether you're on a peaceful nature walk or an adventurous animal-spotting mission, VR Jungle Tour offers a truly immersive, educational, and breathtaking experience. Perfect for explorers of all ages!", "short_description": "Step into the heart of the wild with VR Jungle Tour! Explore lush rainforests, discover exotic animals, and experience nature up close in this immersive virtual reality adventure. A relaxing and thrilling escape into the untouched beauty of the jungle."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "36269221144287